WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:02.502
Alright, what can I say.

00:00:02.752 --> 00:00:04.462
The greatest thrill of my life is

00:00:04.754 --> 00:00:06.131
standing behind that microphone

00:00:06.131 --> 00:00:07.549
with you guys behind me.

00:00:07.841 --> 00:00:08.883
Let's do it.

00:00:10.677 --> 00:00:13.263
I'm in the middle
of a forty-five year conversation

00:00:13.263 --> 00:00:16.099
with these men and women
I'm surrounded by.

00:00:19.477 --> 00:00:24.023
I started playing the guitar because
I was looking for someone to correspond with.

00:00:24.649 --> 00:00:26.151
And after all this time, 

00:00:26.735 --> 00:00:29.863
I still feel that need to talk to you. 

00:00:30.238 --> 00:00:31.698
All right, E Streeters!

00:00:31.698 --> 00:00:32.824
Let's do this thing.

00:00:32.824 --> 00:00:36.032
♪♪

00:00:36.745 --> 00:00:40.874
Our years of playing together
have created an efficiency in the studio.

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:43.455
♪♪

00:00:43.501 --> 00:00:45.503
Ideas tumble around the room. 

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:47.881
Confusion often reigns.

00:00:48.214 --> 00:00:49.340
Do you want me to play it up higher?

00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:51.426
No, don't play it up higher, 
just don't play so low.

00:00:56.389 --> 00:00:57.724
And then suddenly...

00:00:57.724 --> 00:00:58.892
Let's get the claps.

00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:00.643
We'll get the la da da's. 

00:01:00.894 --> 00:01:01.478
Dynamite.

00:01:01.478 --> 00:01:09.603
♪♪

00:01:09.652 --> 00:01:10.236
Perfect!

00:01:10.403 --> 00:01:11.321
Perfect!

00:01:11.321 --> 00:01:18.861
♪♪

00:01:18.912 --> 00:01:21.039
Age brings perspective.

00:01:21.039 --> 00:01:26.827
♪♪

00:01:26.878 --> 00:01:28.630
And after all these years, 

00:01:28.630 --> 00:01:34.708
♪♪

00:01:34.761 --> 00:01:37.263
my friends, wherever you are, 

00:01:37.263 --> 00:01:41.840
♪♪

00:01:41.893 --> 00:01:43.353
you are the reason we're here.

00:01:43.353 --> 00:01:55.018
♪♪

